{
  "sourceId": "post-ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang-zh-TW",
  "locale": "zh-TW",
  "source": {
    "kind": "single-post",
    "postId": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "↵在我之前的文章中，我從其他人分享的提示詞設定了一個遊戲。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "這次，我很興奮地分享我製作了自己的遊戲提示詞。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "文化背景是中國古代的宋朝，而你要保衛襄陽城對抗蒙古大軍！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "這個遊戲是關於中國文化的。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我可以用中文玩這個遊戲嗎？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "LLaMA 3 在理解和書寫中文方面有困難。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "另一方面，中文微調的 LLaMA 3 模型缺乏良好接受指令的能力。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "因此，遊戲將文本從英文翻譯成中文。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "中文遊戲玩法位於本節。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我玩了三次這個遊戲。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "遊戲結局非常有趣。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "一個是我從被摧毀的城市逃脫（多虧一位勇敢的士兵犧牲自己），另一個是我推著一車火藥衝進蒙古營地並打破圍城，最後一個是宋朝皇帝率領軍隊解除圍城並擊敗蒙古入侵者！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "以下是另一個創意遊戲玩法：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "<div class=\"box\">↵ <div class=\"person-a\">↵ <div class=\"icon1\"></div>↵ <div class=\"message\">↵歡迎來到「成為襄陽英雄」！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你從襄陽城的軍營中醒來，因為一夜長眠而感到有點昏沉。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "當你伸展手臂環顧四周時，你注意到守城士兵聚集在城門附近，看起來很擔心。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "其中一人走近你。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "守城衛兵 1：「英雄，您好！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我們這裡遇到了一些麻煩。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我們的火藥供應不足，而且我們不知道如何製造更多。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "您能幫我們弄清楚發生了什麼事嗎？」",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "守城士兵是無法閱讀的徵召兵，沒有化學或現代世界的知識。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "他們完全依賴口頭傳統和實用技能。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你目前的情況：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "城市防禦：0↵蒙古攻擊：2（數量是守軍的 10 倍）↵技術創新：0↵英雄，你想做什麼？↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person a -->↵ ↵<div class=\"person-b\">↵<div class=\"message\">↵讓我們開始這個爆炸派對吧！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在今天的烹飪課程中，我們將製作一些「黑火藥」三明治。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "只需在桌上放一片麵包，倒上 1 茶匙火藥，加一片高麗菜，然後用另一片麵包蓋上。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "品嚐你製作的傑作！↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person b -->↵ <div class=\"person-a\">↵ <div class=\"icon1\"></div>↵ <div class=\"message\">↵守城衛兵 2：「呃，英雄...",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我想這裡可能有些誤會。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我們正試圖保衛我們的城市免受蒙古軍隊的攻擊，而不是做三明治！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "火藥是我們防禦的關鍵組成部分，我們需要弄清楚如何有效地使用它。」",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "守城士兵交換著擔憂的眼神。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "看來你的「烹飪課程」並沒有按計劃進行。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "故事進度：0",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "城市防禦：0↵蒙古攻擊：2（數量是守軍的 10 倍）↵技術創新：0↵危機上升：1（情況每分鐘都在變得更加嚴峻）↵守城士兵開始變得焦躁不安，空氣中的緊張氣氛變得明顯。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "城門在風中發出不祥的吱嘎聲。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "**英雄，你接下來想做什麼？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你會嘗試用新方法挽回自己，還是繼續走...",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "創意烹飪實驗的道路？**↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person a -->↵ ↵<div class=\"person-b\">↵<div class=\"message\">↵讓我們與我們的新蒙古朋友開始派對吧，他們完全迷戀馬奶酒 - 也就是馬奶！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我們會加一些黑火藥讓它更特別，然後踢開大門，準備好與我們的新遊牧夥伴一起暢飲。↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person b -->↵ <div class=\"person-a\">↵ <div class=\"icon1\"></div>↵ <div class=\"message\">↵守城衛兵 3：「英雄，這到底是什麼...？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你不會認真要在馬奶酒裡加火藥吧！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "還要打開城門？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你看到外面的蒙古軍隊了嗎？！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我們正試圖保衛我們的城市，而不是邀請他們來參加派對！」",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "守城士兵開始竊竊私語，顯然對你的建議感到困惑和擔憂。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "故事進度：1",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "城市防禦：0↵蒙古攻擊：2（數量是守軍的 10 倍）↵技術創新：0↵危機上升：2（情況每分鐘都在變得更加嚴峻，城市的命運岌岌可危）↵空氣中的緊張氣氛變得更加明顯，守城士兵交換著擔憂的眼神。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "城門另一側的蒙古戰鼓聲越來越響。↵**英雄，你接下來想做什麼？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你會嘗試挽救局面，還是繼續走...",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "非正統社交的道路？**↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person a -->↵ ↵<div class=\"person-b\">↵<div class=\"message\">↵我說打開城門，歡迎我們的朋友。↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person b --> ↵ <div class=\"person-a\">↵ <div class=\"icon2\"></div>↵ <div class=\"message\">↵蒙古指揮官：「啊，我們終於找到進入襄陽的方法了！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "打開城門，我的戰士們！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我們要讓這些宋朝的傻瓜知道與強大的蒙古帝國作對意味著什麼！」↵（蒙古人衝向城門，準備突破防禦。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "守城士兵驚慌地互相看著，意識到你的行為已經決定了他們的命運。）",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "故事進度：2",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
