        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你接下來做什麼？**↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person a -->↵ ↵<div class=\"person-b\">↵<div class=\"message\">↵盡可能快地跑。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "逃離城市！↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person b --> ↵ <div class=\"person-a\">↵ <div class=\"icon1\"></div>↵ <div class=\"message\">↵守城衛兵 1：「英雄，你在做什麼？！",
      "sourceRef": {
