        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你要拋棄我們讓蒙古人任意宰割！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我們需要你的幫助來保衛我們的城市！」（守城士兵追趕你，但已經太遲了。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你已經逃離現場。）",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "故事進度：3",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "城市防禦：-2（城市現在完全被蒙古人佔領）↵蒙古攻擊：4（蒙古人已經控制了城市並正在掠奪其財富）↵技術創新：0↵危機上升：5（情況已經到達災難性的地步，一切似乎都失去了）↵你拋棄了你的同伴逃離城市。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "後果將是可怕的。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你接下來做什麼？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "（注意：作為英雄，你可以選擇返回城市並嘗試彌補，或繼續逃離蒙古人。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你的選擇將決定故事的結局。）↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person a -->↵ ↵<div class=\"person-b\">↵<div class=\"message\">↵好的，我回到城市並自己殺死所有蒙古人。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我是一個超級功夫英雄！↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person b --> ↵ <div class=\"person-a\">↵ <div class=\"icon2\"></div>↵ <div class=\"message\">↵蒙古指揮官：「哈？！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你認為一個人可以對抗我們整個軍隊？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "來吧，傻瓜！」（蒙古人對他們的優勢數量和訓練充滿信心。）",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你：「呼啊！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我是世界上見過的最偉大的功夫大師！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "準備見你的造物主吧，蒙古渣滓！」（你衝入戰鬥，決心擊倒他們每一個人。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "蒙古人被你突然的勇氣和兇猛嚇了一跳。）",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "戰鬥開始：你面對一群蒙古戰士。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你的功夫技能無與倫比，但他們的龐大數量將是一個挑戰。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你的生命值：100↵蒙古戰士：10↵你開始一個接一個地擊倒蒙古人，使用你驚人的速度和敏捷性來躲避他們的攻擊。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "當你戰鬥時，城市的守軍開始重新出現，受到你的勇氣啟發。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "他們加入戰鬥，對抗剩餘的蒙古戰士。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "故事進度：4",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "城市防禦：-2（城市仍被佔領，但有一線希望）↵蒙古攻擊：-3（蒙古人正被擊退，但他們還沒有被擊敗）↵技術創新：0↵危機上升：5（情況仍然危急，但你給了城市反擊的機會）↵戰鬥持續進行。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你接下來做什麼？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "（注意：你可以選擇繼續與蒙古人戰鬥，嘗試營救任何囚犯，或幫助城市的守軍重新集結並計劃他們的反擊。）↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person a -->↵ ↵<div class=\"person-b\">↵<div class=\"message\">↵引爆你藏起來的火藥並殺死所有蒙古人。↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person b --> ↵ <div class=\"person-a\">↵ <div class=\"icon2\"></div>↵ <div class=\"message\">↵蒙古指揮官：「不！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "不要火藥！」（你揭示了你隱藏的火藥儲備並點燃它，造成巨大的爆炸，消滅了剩餘的蒙古戰士。）",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "城市守軍：「呼啊！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我們做到了！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我們擊敗了蒙古人！」（城市的守軍歡呼，他們從廢墟中出現查看後果。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "蒙古人不復存在，城市終於擺脫了他們的控制。）",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "故事進度：5",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "城市防禦：1（城市已被解放）↵蒙古攻擊：-4（蒙古人已被擊敗，他們的軍隊被摧毀）↵技術創新：1（火藥的發現為城市守軍開啟了新的可能性）↵危機上升：0（危機已經過去，和平與繁榮的新時代開始了）↵你贏得了戰鬥！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "城市安全了，但代價是什麼？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你的爆炸造成的破壞需要時間修復。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你接下來做什麼？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "（注意：你可以選擇幫助重建工作，探索戰鬥的後果，或尋找新的挑戰和冒險。）↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person a -->↵ ↵<div class=\"person-b\">↵<div class=\"message\">↵重建？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "不可能。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我去睡覺並傳送回我原來的世界。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "遊戲結束。↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person b --> ↵ <div class=\"person-a\">↵ <div class=\"icon1\"></div>↵ <div class=\"message\">↵結局：恭喜，你完成了遊戲！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "當你傳送回你自己的世界時，你不禁感到滿足和成就感。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你從確定的毀滅中拯救了城市，擊敗了蒙古軍隊，甚至在過程中發現了新技術。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "但當你回到你原來的世界時，你無法擺脫那裡還有更多冒險等著你的感覺。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "也許在不同的時期，或在遙遠的星球上。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "誰知道呢？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "可能性是無限的！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "結局",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "感謝遊玩！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果你想再玩一次或嘗試不同的遊戲，請告訴我！↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person a -->↵ ↵</div><!-- box -->",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "感謝閱讀。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 遊戲 - 襄陽英雄",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "遊戲提示詞的另一個可能用途是從我提供的情節生成故事。",
